{% comment %}
  ============================================================
  DropPilot — landing page template
  ------------------------------------------------------------
  Renders the DropPilot landing section using the standalone
  "landing" layout (no theme header/footer doubling).

  INSTALL:
  1. Online Store > Themes > Edit code
  2. Under "Templates", click "Add a new template"
     - For: page
     - Type: liquid
     - Name: droppilot
     (Shopify creates templates/page.droppilot.liquid)
  3. Replace its content with THIS file, Save.
  4. Online Store > Pages > Add page (e.g. "Home" / "Start")
     - On the right, "Theme template" > choose "droppilot"
     - Save. Visit the page URL to see the full landing.
  ============================================================
{% endcomment %}
{% layout 'landing' %}
{% section 'droppilot-landing' %}
